# Both builds land inside the Python package, and both are committed there on
# purpose: Streamlit Community Cloud has no npm, and a wheel has to carry the
# component or the Depth Spine page is dead for everyone who pip-installed it.
#   npm run build         -> src/groundwater/depth_spine/frontend/
#   npm run build:inline  -> src/groundwater/depth_spine/static/workspace.html
# Nothing built stays in this directory, so there is no dist/ to negate.
dist
dist-inline
